{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2023-03-10 06:45:00', 'title': "PFIZER'S ZAVZPRET™ (ZAVEGEPANT) MIGRAINE NASAL SPRAY RECEIVES FDA APPROVAL", 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PFIZER INC. (NYSE: PFE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) HAS APPROVED ZAVZPRET™ (ZAVEGEPANT), THE FIRST AND ONLY CALCITONIN GENE-RELATED PEPTIDE (CGRP) RECEPTOR ANTAGONIST NASAL SPRAY FOR THE ACUTE TREATMENT OF MIGRAINE WITH OR WITHOUT AURA IN ADULTS. IN ITS PIVOTAL PHASE 3 STUDY, ZAVZPRET WAS STATISTICALLY SUPERIOR TO PLACEBO ON THE CO-PRIMARY ENDPOINTS OF PAIN FREEDOM AND FREEDOM FROM MOST BOTHERSOME SYMPTOM AT TWO HOURS POST-DOSE.'}